    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Create a Conditional Flowchart\r\n\r\nExplore the flowchart components. Then, create your own flowchart to model the following conditional:\r\n\r\n**Shopping Cart**\r\n- If the user adds at least one item, display the notification badge with the current item total.\r\n- If the user has no items in their cart, hide the badge.\r\n\r\nSave your sketch to your **Backpack**, so you can use it in the following level.",
